From: Sleepy <sleepy@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/amd/display: take the MCCS VCP code from DRM-core AMD VSDB

The DMUB firmware reports freesync_supported for HDMI FreeSync displays but
does not provide the MCCS VCP code (sink->edid_caps.freesync_vcp_code stays
0). The later check in amdgpu_dm_update_freesync_caps():
  if ((HDMI || PCON) && (!freesync_vcp_code ||
      (freesync_vcp_code && !mccs_caps.freesync_supported)))
    freesync_capable = false;
then undoes the freesync_capable that was just set, leaving vrr_capable=0
(verified at runtime: fs_sup=1 fscap=1 vcp=0 mccs=0).

drm_edid.c (patch 0050) parses the AMD VSDB directly and provides
connector->display_info.amd_vsdb.freesync_vcp_code. Set
sink->edid_caps.freesync_vcp_code + sink->mccs_caps.freesync_supported from
it in the main HDMI branch so the reset no longer fires. Includes temporary
pr_info diagnostics.

Signed-off-by: Sleepy <sleepy@localhost>
Assisted-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c
index 9a80c41095fc..4a89bee8305f 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_connector.c
@@ -3920,6 +3920,25 @@ void amdgpu_dm_update_freesync_caps(struct drm_connector *connector,
 				connector->display_info.monitor_range.min_vfreq = vsdb_info.min_refresh_rate_hz;
 				connector->display_info.monitor_range.max_vfreq = vsdb_info.max_refresh_rate_hz;
 			}
+
+			/*
+			 * The DMUB firmware reports freesync_supported but does not
+			 * provide the MCCS VCP code, and the later
+			 * freesync_vcp_code/mccs reset would undo freesync_capable.
+			 * Take the VCP code from the DRM-core AMD VSDB parse
+			 * (drm_edid.c, patch 0050).
+			 */
+			if (connector->display_info.amd_vsdb.freesync_vcp_code) {
+				sink->edid_caps.freesync_vcp_code =
+					connector->display_info.amd_vsdb.freesync_vcp_code;
+				sink->mccs_caps.freesync_supported = true;
+				pr_info("sleepy-next VRR: set vcp=%d mccs=1 (fs_sup=%d)\n",
+					sink->edid_caps.freesync_vcp_code,
+					connector->display_info.amd_vsdb.freesync_supported);
+			} else {
+				pr_info("sleepy-next VRR: no vcp in amd_vsdb (fs_sup=%d)\n",
+					connector->display_info.amd_vsdb.freesync_supported);
+			}
 		}
 
 		drm_dbg_driver(adev_to_drm(adev),
